OL,3,GNEWSABluetongue restrictions continue
OL,4,Awith disease 'not going away'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf an animal is showing clinical signs
OL,7,Fof bluetongue, it must be reported
OL,8,Fimmediately to the Animal and Plant
OL,9,FHealth Agency.
